   "npc": "3596",
   "questID": 3117,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You've arrived, and none too soon, $N. Welcome to Shadowglen.\n\nI trust my sigil found you in good spirits and health?\n\nAs I said previously, I am here to train you as a $c; to tame beasts to aid you in battle; to use a bow with unerring accuracy; to respect the lands which we call home and also the lands beyond.",
